<title>FRANCE: Tokyo sets 1.7 bln Ffr 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Tokyo sets 1.7 bln Ffr 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced</p>
<p>by the lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER - City of Tokyo</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - IBJ France</p>
<p> AMT   1.7 BLN FRF	COUPON     5.75	MATURITY 25.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE  STRAIGHT	   ISS PRICE  99.846    PAY DATE 25.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	   REOFFER    99.846    ACCRUAL  25.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	   FULL FEES  32.5 BP   SPREAD   +12 BP*</p>
<p>* Spread calculated over interpolated yield of 5.5 percent 2007 and 8.5 percent 2008 French government bonds (OATs).  </p>
<p>Credit Agricole Indosuez was appointed senior co-lead manager for the deal, the first French franc issue by Tokyo.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
